WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.540
[Desert wind]
Dustfall.

2
00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.800
Halloween eighteen eighty-seven.

3
00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:07.140
A fallen star brought strangers to the frontier.

4
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.980
Tonight a peace treaty promised a new beginning.

5
00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.040
[Electrical snap]
Then the lights went out.

6
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:13.680
The mayor is dead.

7
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.340
The power core is gone.

8
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.042
[Containment field hums]
One of you is hiding the truth.
